OL,3,GNEWSA'No nation left behind' says
OL,4,ABurnham after meeting first ministers
OL,5,Ain Glasgow
OL,6,
OL,7,FSNP leader John Swinney said he
OL,8,Fwelcomed recognition that "Westminster
OL,9,Fis not working for Scotland" and
OL,10,Fpledged to work "constructively and
OL,11,Fcollaboratively" with Burnham, while
OL,12,FPlaid Cymru leader Rhun ap Iowerth said
OL,13,Fthe meeting was "positive".
OL,15,FBoth first ministers have called for a
OL,16,Fwider conversation about independence
OL,17,Fbut Burnham has ruled out referendums.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
